# Never commit .env (or any file with real values); it is ignored by .gitignore.
#
# The yt-library server is configured through /etc/yt-library/yt-library.env,
# created by install.sh from deploy/yt-library.env.example. See that file for
# every setting and its default.
#
# For local development you can copy it here instead:
#   cp deploy/yt-library.env.example .env
# and load it with:  set -a; . ./.env; set +a
